                <p>&gt; Auth: {user.gln} validated.</p>
                <p>&gt; Polling SAP instance at sap.prod.corp...</p>
                <p>&gt; Heartbeat OK. Listening for EPCIS Events.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
      </div>
