  LayoutDashboard, Truck, FileText, LogOut, Bot, ScanLine, Box, ShieldCheck, 
  Building2, Menu, X, Wallet, Settings, Wine, Stamp, Pill, Globe, ShoppingBag, Leaf, Cpu
